      "uid": "zhcn:00e821a74dc87fe589afb141",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "靠近内侧围栏一带取位竞争格外激烈，\n还要承受其他赛马娘施加的压力，\n状况容易生变。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e96f2ae812ac56da05e429d89dc9210a489f7709ffe0f6edefa3c7b6e4b5d251",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
