    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2e0ae4d4b72844a78519ef5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "假设大鸣大放跑了2414米，\n我跑了2403米，\n这状况下我能够领先11米……",
