    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0d944d852ed7beb1a27eb0a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她原本就个性冷静，在「东京运动杯」中\n被紧张击垮后更是为此反省，\n又特地锻炼加强了此一特质。",
      "source_fingerprint": "15da8b955736c828880fa7d0fa7f502d9abc05cd6c41b3114ba984140eb9685a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1088/storytimeline_501088114.json",
      "json_path": [
