      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "此外我还有足够强劲的毅力，不会受其他赛马娘\n施压影响，能够坚持住紧贴内侧围栏前进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbda59f0ba1924eb7e4dcf69f7ae6ff57c43d1b635ee0e36086c54b9adcf341e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
