    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f4bb938f1500cce749c61f1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "采用此作战时，\n绝对严禁过度在意大鸣大放。\n对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "633025d833ff956de17ebc59be8ad120b13d99ea8957302891cfe814ffc7f704",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1088/storytimeline_501088114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df7cc27b50e1336038de54a8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这作战内容简单来说，\n就是「别去管场上有谁在，\n坚持做自己擅长的事」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ec80c75bf0a067820ffde4f3147e64db439e593adb2c2851c349a2345b65612",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1088/storytimeline_501088114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:236c4a0f79e09e39f2f8af2e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……但这却出乎意料地困难。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbaa96c0c4a546f8e6051f14de1b2d71688cebf44eb4029fb14b72b023a2f7b4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1088/storytimeline_501088114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c94c666ffc56f6dbc03b836e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "若论起为何至今都没能想到这个对策，\n正是因为自「皋月赏」起，\n我们就将重点放在防范大鸣大放。",
